// Per-developer code signing template.
//
// Copy this to `Signing.local.xcconfig` (git-ignored) and set your Team ID:
//   cp ios/Signing.local.xcconfig.example ios/Signing.local.xcconfig
//
// Find your Team ID in Xcode → Settings → Accounts → (your team), or run:
//   security find-identity -v -p codesigning   # the 10-char ID in parentheses
//
// The Podfile's post_install hook appends an optional `#include?` of
// `Signing.local.xcconfig` to the app's Pods base xcconfig, so running
//   bundle exec pod install
// wires it up. Because the include is optional, a clone WITHOUT this file
// (e.g. CI) still builds — it just won't have a signing team set.
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = YOUR_TEAM_ID
